Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the complete masterclass\Non House Rent Allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will walk through the\Nconsolidated instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Department of\NExpenditure, dated the thirtieth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,of December, twenty twenty\Ntwo, paragraph by paragraph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We will also flag, very\Nclearly, where the printed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,rate is no longer the rate\Nyou actually draw today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us begin with Riya's first question.
